      "message": "@Robert Yes, good, it should be removed since it is already controlled by the capability config (see https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/base/+/1440613/9/telephony/java/android/telephony/TelephonyManager.java#14419).\n\n@Daniel Already done.",
