      "lineNbr": 432,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-05T20:08:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "capacity should be a separate request/response pair rather than tucked into this.\n\nI\u0027m also concerned on over-reliance on the capacity data.  The old File-based API is still functional and so things can change.  We should expect and support errors when exceeding capacity in the updates codepath.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 432,
        "startChar": 81,
        "endLine": 432,
        "endChar": 89
      },
      "revId": "29bd6a45f5f46c53a5082e83035d9ffc9a0160c3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a2691f17_f3c71254",
        "filename": "radio/1.6/IRadioResponse.hal",
