      },
      "lineNbr": 432,
      "author": {
        "id": 1156349
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-09T10:22:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it’s good to add one separate API to get the capacity, how about the API name getSimPhoneBookCapacity?\n\nWe could add the capacity support in legacy file-based codes step by step. But it won\u0027t impact current HAL change.\n\nSo how about we quickly conclude the HAL APIs firstly before the HAL frozen? Later we could finish the main framework solution and add more support in legacy codes as well?",
